sentences.text:
It is provided that till the next date of listing in the event of arrest of the applicant- Leena Singh involved in the above noted case, she shall be released on anticipatory bail on her furnishing personal bond of Rs.30,000/- each with two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of the Station House Officer of the Police Station concerned/ Investigating Officer subject to the following conditions:
(1) The applicant shall appear before the investigating officer as and when required and in this regard shall appear before the investigation or in her absence before the S.H.O. concerned and shall provide her mobile number on which she may be contacted.
(2) The applicant shall make himself available for interrogation or for discovery of any fact by a police officer as and when required;
(3) The applicant shall not, directly or indirectly, make any inducement, threat or promise to any person acquainted with the facts of the case so as to dissuade them from disclosing such facts to the Court or to any police officer;
(4) The applicant shall not leave the District concerned without the previous permission of the Court."
Leena Singh vs State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Home Lko.

